247
00:16:37,380 --> 00:16:40,557
I knew that I had found exactly
what I had been searching for.

248
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:45,600
Of course, it was necessary to
influence certain events in your lives.

249
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:48,557
What do you mean, influence?

250
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:51,680
I see I'm going to need
to spell this out for you.

251
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,660
Let's start with Alistair.

252
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:58,757
His family was captured
by Gozaburo Kaiba's tanks

253
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:01,477
during his effort to
take over their township.

254
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:02,620
What's your point?

255
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:05,080
Is that story true, Mokuba?

256
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:09,240
Unfortunately, it is.

257
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:10,690
Of course.

258
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:14,900
What Alistair doesn't know is that
Kaiba's father didn't do a thing.

259
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:17,020
That armor belongs to me.

260
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:22,189
We couldn't have done
this without you, Mr.

261
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,130
Kaiba.

262
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:36,160
And then there's poor Valon, who practically
grew up in a juvenile detention center.

263
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:38,257
Thanks once again to yours truly.

264
00:17:38,340 --> 00:17:41,840
I framed him for his first
crime at the age of nine.

265
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,400
And of course we can't
forget about you, Raphael.

266
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:50,480
Ah, that stormy night. Not that.

267
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,800
You couldn't have.

268
00:17:55,620 --> 00:17:56,450
Guys!

269
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:01,300
Your captain didn't take
you into that typhoon.

270
00:18:03,260 --> 00:18:06,260
It was I who led your ship astray.

271
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:07,990
No!

272
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:09,170
But why?

273
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:13,597
You're going to have to start
paying attention one of these days.

274
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:17,060
I watched you master duel
monsters at a young age,

275
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:19,740
but I needed to unlock your inner fury.

276
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:23,688
It was the only way to make sure
that you were strong enough.

277
00:18:24,280 --> 00:18:28,104
After all, I had the three legendary
dragons to contend with now.

278
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:31,077
And quite frankly, your
life was a bit too perfect.

279
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:33,660
So I made some adjustments.

280
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,030
Raphael!

281
00:18:35,113 --> 00:18:36,697
You mustn't listen to him!

282
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:39,200
Everything is your fault.

283
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:41,460
You took me from my family.

284
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:47,440
I needed your anger.

285
00:18:47,940 --> 00:18:49,820
Your thirst for revenge.

286
00:18:55,580 --> 00:18:58,520
You ruined my life!

287
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:01,320
You monster!

288
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,270
No!

289
00:19:11,353 --> 00:19:13,480
It's the seal of Orycalchos!

290
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:16,307
Yeah, but I didn't see
anyone play that hard.

291
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:20,990
No!

292
00:19:21,073 --> 00:19:22,280
It's Guardian Iathos!

293
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:25,200
Raphael, control your anger!

294
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,280
You can stop the seal!

295
00:19:28,940 --> 00:19:30,080
Wrong, Pharaoh.

296
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:34,017
The Orycalchos lives within him
and can never be extinguished.

297
00:19:34,100 --> 00:19:38,900
Its glow burns in his heart, and I'm
afraid there's no turning back now.

298
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,400
His soul belongs to me.

299
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,760
He's been captured!

300
00:20:02,360 --> 00:20:03,190
Raphael!

301
00:20:03,273 --> 00:20:04,300
Oh, man!

302
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,880
Can you hear us?

303
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:15,540
Another soul, another step closer
to awakening the great beast.

304
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:20,660
All right, this ends now!

305
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:22,380
How right you are.

306
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,600
I'm just about done.

307
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:29,357
Once I play this card,
your fate will be sealed.

308
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:33,980
For the seal of Orichalcos is
about to become even stronger.

309
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,960
What are you up to, darts?

310
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,340
It can't be good.

311
00:20:38,580 --> 00:20:43,560
And now, it's time to experience
the third level of darkness. Go!

312
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:46,360
Orichalcos Tritos!
